/*
 * The stock firmware (your dump, firmware/raga-stock.sb, unpacked by sbtoelf
 * into build/fw/) with the Tamagotchi added to the two player sections: 'play'
 * and 'pSay' (charge & play). After play0 (LCD init, boot logo) tama.elf
 * runs; it returns only when BACK is held at power-on, and then the original
 * player (play1 / pSay1) loads as before. Every other section is unchanged.
 * Options are copied from the stock image.
 */
